      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand, but many user-related migrations can only be performed when they log in. The way we usually deal with it is to assume users that don\u0027t log-in in an N-month interval won\u0027t likely login again in the future. Current plan is removing migration after 6 months of landing.\n\nNot much we can do about this: we can\u0027t even track and report the number of unmigrated templates because we don\u0027t have access to the user\u0027s templates (even the number of templates) if they don\u0027t log in.",
